    "detailed_description": "<strong>Sudokolorful</strong> is a color-based puzzle game, suitable for color blindness, based on the classic Sudoku game.<br>Your main objective is to fill every empty spot with a color, being careful to not repeat colors in the same line, column and neighborhood (bigger squares).<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693610/extras/2b6746a6ee8bf77d41e05f71170f2ebc.poster.avif?t=1686087574\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693610/extras/2b6746a6ee8bf77d41e05f71170f2ebc.webm?t=1686087574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693610/extras/2b6746a6ee8bf77d41e05f71170f2ebc.mp4?t=1686087574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Challenge your brain with different types of Sudoku: <strong>4x4, 6x6 and 9x9</strong></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Progressive mode</strong> with 50 unique challenges and 4 variations each.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Choose between three difficulties: <strong>easy, medium and hard</strong> on Classic mode. Up to 90 challenges available in this mode.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Color blindness? Change to <strong>Colorblind Friendly</strong> palette. Color palette carefully thought for every type of color blindness but Achromatopsia</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Save your current game</strong> anytime</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Do you prefer the <strong>classic Sudoku</strong>? Turn the numbers on</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Sudokolorful</strong> is a color-based puzzle game, suitable for color blindness, based on the classic Sudoku game.<br>Your main objective is to fill every empty spot with a color, being careful to not repeat colors in the same line, column and neighborhood (bigger squares).<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693610/extras/2b6746a6ee8bf77d41e05f71170f2ebc.poster.avif?t=1686087574\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693610/extras/2b6746a6ee8bf77d41e05f71170f2ebc.webm?t=1686087574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693610/extras/2b6746a6ee8bf77d41e05f71170f2ebc.mp4?t=1686087574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Challenge your brain with different types of Sudoku: <strong>4x4, 6x6 and 9x9</strong></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Progressive mode</strong> with 50 unique challenges and 4 variations each.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Choose between three difficulties: <strong>easy, medium and hard</strong> on Classic mode. Up to 90 challenges available in this mode.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Color blindness? Change to <strong>Colorblind Friendly</strong> palette. Color palette carefully thought for every type of color blindness but Achromatopsia</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Save your current game</strong> anytime</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Do you prefer the <strong>classic Sudoku</strong>? Turn the numbers on</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "When Sudoku meets Pixel Art. Play with colors (7 palettes, including colorblind friendly). The game has Progressive and Classic Mode. Progressive Mode has 50 themed challenges with 4 variations each. Classic mode has 90 challenges. Both modes have 4x4, 6x6 and 9x9. Display number and notes available",
